as  repeatedly told his housemates that hype  house wasn't making any money  and yet the formerly broke team 10-star  bragged about expensive purchases like  an $8,000 bracelet and a $10,000 cat  Thomas allegedly even talked about  buying a brand new Tesla  this caused hype House members to get a  little suspicious  what's worse is that Thomas refused to  give anyone the account passwords  we can't ever have any group decisions  like everything is him like he somehow  has authority over everything so what  was he hiding  Daisy also revealed that Thomas wouldn't  give any of the team members access to  the hide house Instagram account  Daisy soon realized that Thomas enjoy  telling people what to do she even went  as far as to say that living in  house was like living under a Thomas  touch of dictatorship if things weren't  bad enough already  Thomas approached Daisy asking her to  manipulate a potential hype House member  this and one more thing would lead to  Daisy ending her friendship with Thomas  for good according to Daisy Thomas  wanted her to act like she was this  mystery girl's best friend to lock her  down as a tik-tok collaborator I never  thought in a million years he would do  something like this to me Daisy couldn't  believe what Thomas was suggesting  that's when she realized that he was  constantly manipulating people for  personal gain following this incident a  co-founder approached Thomas with a  press deal but Thomas forbade him from  taking part in it according to Daisy  Thomas justified things by saying it's  not your decision because I make all the  decisions around here Thomas started  making legal decisions behind Daisy's  back too that's when Daisy fired back  confronting Thomas about his actions and  the way he treated people he apologized  to her face and said he would be more  inclusive and transparent but chose to  cut her out behind the scenes Daisy's  lawyer / manager called her up soon  after to inform her about what Thomas  was seei