ipping and using his  influence to make others think that  Daisy was problematic however most of  the members had experienced Thomas's  manipulative ways firsthand so they  remained in contact with Daisy on March  9 2020 it was revealed that the hype  house Instagram page had unfollowed  members like Patrick Houston Connor  Yates Calvin gulby and Wyatt Xavier so  it's believed that these members chose  to stick by Daisy's side but things  weren't as simple for Alex and Kivar who  have remained silent over the feud the  same goes for Charlie D'Amelio all drama  aside Daisy is choosing to take the high  road and let the port's handle the rest  when it comes down to deep down in my  heart I forgive I forgive however legal  battles could take the backseat now that  social distancing laws have come into  effect  Daisy informed fans in her tell-all  YouTube video that this would be the  last time she talked about the issue she  just wanted to clear the air and tell  her side of the story  Daisy is choosing to take her hype house  experience as a life lesson which she  says she'll grow from but if there's one  thing the tick talker is truly done with  it speak la  Daisy is ready for the next chapter in  her life I'm gonna show you the next  chapter in my life and I'm really really  excited to share this with you if  there's one thing Daisy wants fans to  take from all of this it's to always  trust their intuition she also stresses  the importance of getting things into  writing before putting money down Daisy  wants to surround herself with positive  people especially now that March 2020 is  coming to a close and social distancing  rules are in full swing on a lighter  note  Daisy cute was spotted shopping with  Brody Jenner on Friday March 27th at a  supermarket in Los Angeles according to  E news the pair were seen flirting  before Daisy got into Brody's car what  do you think about Daisy's take on  Thomas and chase sound off in the  comments and be sure to tell us what 